Last weekend, Malis travelled to Kampot with her family. They stayed with Grandma. On Saturday, Malis helped Grandma. They cooked fish soup, and Malis washed the dishes. On Sunday, she climbed a small hill, jumped in the river and painted a picture of the sunset.

